<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLISH COUNTY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLISH COUNTY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of four-day English</p>
<p>County Championship cricket matches on Monday:</p>
<p>At The Oval: Surrey v Yorkshire match drawn. Surrey 549 and</p>
<p>153. Yorkshire 387 and 115-4 (D.Lehmann 57 not out). Surrey 11</p>
<p>points Yorkshire 10.</p>
<p>At Bristol: Worcestershire beat Gloucestershire by 95 runs.</p>
<p>Worcestershire 250 and 350-4 declared. Gloucestershire 229 and</p>
<p>276 (J.Russell 65). Worcester 22 points Gloucester 5.</p>
<p>At Edgbaston: Warwickshire v Derbyshire match drawn.</p>
<p>Derbyshire 200 and 229-3 declared (A.Rollins 59, K.Barnett 54).</p>
<p>Warwickshire 340. Warwickshire 10 points Derbyshire 8.</p>
<p>At Old Trafford: Kent beat Lancashire by 58 runs. Kent 373</p>
<p>and 217-9 declared (D.Shadford 4-67). Lancashire 285 and 247</p>
<p>(J.Crawley 91; P.Strang 4-68). Kent 24 points Lancashire 6.</p>
</text>
